<%# app/views/booking_mailer/appointment_reminder.text.erb %>

Hi <%= @user.first_name %>,

This is a reminder that your appointment with <%= @business.business_name %>
starts in approximately one hour.

Service: <%= @service.name %>
Date: <%= @booking.date.strftime("%-d %B %Y") %>
Time: <%= @booking.time.strftime("%-I:%M %p") %>

<% if @remaining_balance.positive? %>
  Remaining balance: <%= number_to_currency(@remaining_balance, unit: "£") %>

  You currently have <%= number_to_currency(@remaining_balance, unit: "£") %> remaining to pay for this appointment.
<% end %>

We look forward to seeing you.